n":"使用1次个性化轮盘","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/d18118d6f1b5d1f8f3c25f3d29e596c675f1d1d2.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":38,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":1},{"strID":"10000009","strName":"多元挑战","strDescription":"完成1场娱乐模式比赛","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/32a4ddfb4865f343b913d32a220d1de42d9cd3c5.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":32.099998474121094,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":1},{"strID":"3","strName":"冉冉新星","strDescription":"等级达到20级","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/7026756717dfca13214b1fb49f9235cecda18c7f.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":23.399999618530273,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":1,"flMaxProgress":20},{"strID":"20000030","strName":"美味海底\"捞\"！","strDescription":"作为陆行鲨杰夫，使用“杰夫来也！”一口气吞下4名敌人","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/0ce5857cb16e0c7ab1315ebef16428ca5409a0da.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":20.600000381469727,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"20000020","strName":"横扫饥饿","strDescription":"作为毒液，使用“腐蚀”同时缠绕4名敌人","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/935df99944bd4de1f0f79f91ceb693ba3d56b0c0.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":20.399999618530273,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"20000027","strName":"为了米兰诺号！","strDescription":"作为星爵，在银河护卫队成员的助攻下达成10次击败","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/2d4f8005c84b9e407b953957cb43ae79cebb8837.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":19.5,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"20000015","strName":"代表月亮惩罚你","strDescription":"作为月光骑士，使用“孔苏之拳”同时击中4名敌人","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/730445118ad850a0504870f23b4b19e4f7856240.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":18,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"20000019","strName":"无暇战术","strDescription":"作为钢铁侠，使用“无敌脉冲炮”同时击中4名敌人","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/291ce3a08ea5fefedc18dd6d59c64c9f7c2ad317.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":16.799999237060547,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"20000007","strName":"西岸以西","strDescription":"作为鹰眼，与复仇者成员搭档共同达成10次击败","strImage":"https://cdn.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2767030/d28ce0120ec786946b226e697342f21b1ac8b9ac.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":16.299999237060547,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":40,"nAchieved":0}}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"NetEase Games","strURL":null}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"NetEase Games","strURL":null}],"rgFranchises":[]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[p][img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/JUSTICE-0712-1.gif?t=1741923063[/img][/p][p]《漫威争锋》是一款超级英雄团队PVP射击游戏。你可以从丰富多样的超级英雄和超级反派阵容中，挑选心仪的角色组成全明星队伍，在漫威多元宇宙各种可破坏的地图上，利用独特的超能力进行精彩激战。 [/p][p]\r\n[/p][h2]漫威正版授权，首款超级英雄团队PVP射击大作[/h2][p]你可以从复仇者联盟、银河护卫队、X战警等漫威多元宇宙中的诸多团队中，选择脍炙人口、别具一格的漫威超级英雄或反派进行战斗，如黑豹、蜘蛛侠、万磁王和魔剑客等经典角色。\r\n[/p][p][img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/1.A_Deep_and_vaired.gif?t=1741923063[/img][/p][h2]6v6快节奏刺激对战，战局瞬息万变[/h2][p]错综复杂的战场设计，节奏紧张的游戏体验，变幻莫测的战斗局势，你在《漫威争锋》中永远不会感到无聊！成为拥有惊人能力的超级英雄或超级反派，利用你的力量，瞬间就能将战场变得趣味横生。化身为你最爱的超级英雄踏上战场，享受一场酣畅淋漓的决斗吧！\r\n[/p][p][img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/2.fast_and_fun_6V6.gif?t=1741923063[/img][/p][h2]经典英雄独特技能，团战配合协作无间[/h2][p]英雄间的羁绊将触发连携技能，多样协作赋予战术更多可能：你可化身为火箭浣熊站在格鲁特背上，对敌人进行猛烈进攻；或化身为浩克释放伽马能量为钢铁侠的盔甲充能，超能力激发巨大战斗力，赢得战场先机......还有更多精彩等着你去探索！\r\n[/p][p][img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/4.creative_environment_destruction.gif?t=1741923063[/img][/p][h2]地图场景可破坏，颠覆既定战场规则[/h2][p]战场不再死气沉沉，它将成为制胜武器！你将在经典的漫威世界场景中战斗，穿行于千变万化的战场之中，使用超能力改变环境，重新塑造地形，并在战场上创造战略优势；你还可以寻找掩体躲避攻击，或是将现场物品化作临时武器反击敌人。在这里，你有无数种空间场景战术来赢得胜利！\r\n[/p][p][img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/3.dynamic_hero.gif?t=1741923063[/img][/p][h2]不断扩张的漫威宇宙，丰富的赛季更新[/h2][p]漫威多元宇宙也为《漫威争锋》带来了无尽的可能性。故事将会跟随赛季逐步推进，每个赛季更新都会有新的超级英雄或反派加入战场，并引入更多充满挑战性的地图。你可以在各种玩法策略中运用每个赛季解锁的新内容，体验到惊险刺激的战斗和无限可能性！\r\n[/p][p][img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767030/extras/5.continually_evolving_universe.gif?t=1741923063[/img][/p]","strSnippet":"《漫威争锋》是一款由漫威IP正版授权、网易自研的超级英雄PVP团队射击游戏。玩家可以从丰富多样的超级英雄阵容中挑选心仪角色，组成全明星队伍，在漫威多元宇宙中各种可破坏的地图上，利用独特的超能力进行精彩激战。成为超级英雄，集结你的小队，一起战斗吧！"}}]]